          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Custom topics use either Shared Access Signature (SAS) or key authentication. Microsoft recommends SAS, but key authentication provides simple programming, and is compatible with many existing webhook publishers."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
