            "type": "text",
            "value": "Box 2: ValidationCode handshake -"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Event Grid supports two ways of validating the subscription: ValidationCode handshake (programmatic) and ValidationURL handshake (manual)."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "If you control the source code for your endpoint, this method is recommended."
          },
